{"4743950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Titanhelm", "steam_appid": 4743950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Titanhelm is a co-op base building survival game for 1 to 4 players. Construct a settlement, upgrade your Titan, and hold out against waves of creatures before the timer runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Titan</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget armies. Your titan is a powerful tool to fight of enemies you can unlock different weapons to use</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4743950/extras/2da2bb16824703804eca92bc6f2be291.avif?t=1787398527\" width=200 height=400 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4743950/extras/309b4325a9a47c46b29fbb4139bccb0e.avif?t=1787398527\" width=200 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Threat Level System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place Soul Collector buildings near your defences to harvest Souls from fallen enemies. Every collector you place raises the forest's Threat Level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the Waves</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waves hit on a fixed timer whether you are ready or not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play With Friends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo or with up to three friends online. Every decision hits differently when the whole base is on the line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4743950/extras/fdc74e61b03686063937d5442b9aba85.avif?t=1787398527\" width=300 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Co-op survival for 1 to 4 players online</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Titan upgrade system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dynamic threat level system controlled by your own choices</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fixed wave timer with escalating difficulty</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Soul Collector buildings that trade safety for power</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Enemy camps and optional objectives across the map</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Four resource types each with their own storage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Campaign of increasingly brutal levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Titanhelm is a co-op base building survival game for 1 to 4 players. Construct a settlement, upgrade your Titan, and hold out against waves of creatures before the timer runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Titan</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget armies. Your titan is a powerful tool to fight of enemies you can unlock different weapons to use</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4743950/extras/2da2bb16824703804eca92bc6f2be291.avif?t=1787398527\" width=200 height=400 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4743950/extras/309b4325a9a47c46b29fbb4139bccb0e.avif?t=1787398527\" width=200 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Threat Level System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place Soul Collector buildings near your defences to harvest Souls from fallen enemies. Every collector you place raises the forest's Threat Level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the Waves</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waves hit on a fixed timer whether you are ready or not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play With Friends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo or with up to three friends online. Every decision hits differently when the whole base is on the line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4743950/extras/fdc74e61b03686063937d5442b9aba85.avif?t=1787398527\" width=300 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Co-op survival for 1 to 4 players online</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Titan upgrade system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dynamic threat level system controlled by your own choices</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fixed wave timer with escalating difficulty</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Soul Collector buildings that trade safety for power</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Enemy camps and optional objectives across the map</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Four resource types each with their own storage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Campaign of increasingly brutal levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Titanhelm is a co-op base building game where you and your friends build a settlement, command a Titan and fight back the creatures of a dark and hostile forest. Gather resources, harvest Soul energy from fallen enemies and upgrade your Titan before the forest consumes you.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4743950/2988dc2c592098ca9b2aabe3aa514941f2413e54/header.jpg?t=1787398527", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4743950/8c34cb4d3c220151631194611bf49e6a9e6bbd80/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787398527", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4743950/8c34cb4d3c22015163